      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0b8fe6abbb88a1a40bafe63230fa6126, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.lines.Array.size
      value: 6
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: requiredBadgeDevelopment
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7551b4b5f7513944fbf8d823c16ee4a1, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[0]'
      value: "Gah! I HATE Pok\xE9mon! It's terrible!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[1]'
      value: "Don't even get me started on Pok\xE9mon GO! That game is an abomination
        to the whole multiverse!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[2]'
      value: "Oh, so you actually LIKE Pok\xE9mon?! Well then, how about a battle?!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[3]'
      value: "...What? Why am I participating in a Pok\xE9mon battle even though
        I hate Pok\xE9mon?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[4]'
      value: Well, buster, this battle is the only thing keeping me from transcending
        into a higher plane of existence!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[5]'
      value: Win or lose, it doesn't matter! Let's just get this over with...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: questToCompleteAfterBattle
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f7efc0693547d114e870fe47c75bb620, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: questToCompleteBeforeBattle
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6a86a2c1a15dd75428dd2a4d68ddb146, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogAfterBattle.lines.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogRefuseBattle.lines.Array.size
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogAfterBattle.lines.Array.data[0]'
      value: "Well, it's official. I'm finally giving up on Pok\xE9mon once and for
        all."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogAfterBattle.lines.Array.data[1]'
      value: It was good in comparison to the hardware while said hardware was simple
        and lame, but now it feels too bland for something that could be so much
        more.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogAfterBattle.lines.Array.data[2]'
      value: "I guess I have no use staying here anymore. At least now I can teleport
        to a fan game based on a franchise that's way better than Pok\xE9mon."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogAfterBattle.lines.Array.data[3]'
      value: And that franchise is Raid Shadow Legends!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogAfterBattle.lines.Array.data[4]'
      value: "...Ha ha, just kidding. But seriously, now I can go into Minecraft,
        which is way better than Pok\xE9mon."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogAfterBattle.lines.Array.data[5]'
      value: Sure, the graphics are pretty terrible on their own, but at least the
        gameplay is a solid S-tier.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogAfterBattle.lines.Array.data[6]'
      value: Well, see ya! Wouldn't want to be ya!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogRefuseBattle.lines.Array.data[0]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogRefuseBattle.lines.Array.data[1]'
      value: "I may not like Pok\xE9mon at all, but the ones I've got will probably
        destroy you unless you have the Marsh Badge."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogRefuseBattle.lines.Array.data[2]'
      value: If you want to challenge me after then, I'll be waiting.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogRefuseBattleDevelopment.lines.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogRefuseBattleDevelopment.lines.Array.data[0]'
      value: Ugh. Don't battle me until you have at least two badges, okay?!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogRefuseBattleDevelopment.lines.Array.data[1]'
      value: "I may not like Pok\xE9mon at all, but the ones I've got will probably
        destroy you unless you have the Marsh Badge."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogRefuseBattleDevelopment.lines.Array.data[2]'
      value: If you want to challenge me after then, I'll be waiting.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1747727796819585287, guid: e166e92400ba39f4d8328f907585579c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogRefuseBattleDevelopment.lines.Array.data[3]'
      value: "Oh, and you can use Rare Candies to train your Pok\xE9mon if you need
        to. Don't forget it!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
